  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b4ae5e38c4837a4e5fad38036d4e9c4f5ec902325054f6f26e269365ad507296.png] \n\n**Given : **62 * 17 * 6 * 81 * 23 * 2 * 37 \n\nLets check each option:\n\n1) +, =, ÷, −, +, × \n\n62 + 17 =__** 6 ÷ 81**__ - 23 + 2 × 37\n\n62 + 17 = 0.07 - 23 + __**2 × 37 **__\n\n__**62 + 17**__ =__** 0.07**__ - 23 **__+ 74__**\n\n79 = __**74.07 - 23**__\n\n__**79 ≠ 51.07**__\n\n2) −, ×, =, −, +, ×\n\n62 - __**17 × 6**__ = 81 - 23 +__** 2 × 37**__\n\n62 - 102 = __**81**__ - 23 __**+ 74**__\n\n__**62 - 102 **__=__** 155 - 23**__\n\n**__- 40 ≠ 132__**\n\n3) =, −, ×, +, −, +\n\n62 = 17** **- __**6 × 81**__ + 23 - 2 + 37\n\n62 = __**17**__ - 486 __**+ 23**__ - 2__** + 37**__\n\n62 = __**77 - 488**__\n\n__**62 ≠ - 411**__\n\n4) +, ×, −, =, ×, +\n\n62 + __**17 × 6**__ - 81 =__** 23 × 2 **__+ 37\n\n__**62 + 102**__ - 81 =__** 46 + 37**__\n\n__**164 - 81 **__= 83\n\n__**83 = 83 **__\n\nHence, **'+, ×, −, =, ×, +'** is the correct answer.",
